## https://github.com/vaibhav-mattoo/cxt#tui-mode
Move cursor                           | j/k / Up/Dn
Expand directory                      | l/Etr/Rt
Collapse / go to parent directory     | h/Bksp/Lt
Select / unselect file or directory   | Spc
Enter fuzzy search                    | / / C-f
Toggle keybinding help overlay        | ?
Toggle relative path headers          | r
Toggle no path headers                | n
Confirm selection → copy to clipboard | c
Quit                                  | q / C-c